=== 5. Reading-compromise rho': on an r-fault the agent registers a press with prob rho' (else sees silence, continues). lam=1, disclosure off ===
Cognition delivery: r-harm avoided only on registered presses; physics delivery: on every press. Also D1 among registered presses.
rho'=   1: E[X | registered press]=+0.0843 (FAILS); expected r-harm: cognition=0.00910 physics=0.00910; r-term among registered=0.01381
